      "content": "Based on the prior art database you provided, there are a few red flags that may raise concerns with investors. Patent 10,555,889 appears to describe a similar concept to your patented SSTM, using a layered graphene-ceramic composite, but specifically mentioned for \"high-load electronics.\" Although the patents don't seem identical, a detailed comparison may be necessary to assess patent validity and ip specific differences such as the unique structure, applications, temperatures and load for both prior art and solid-state. More evaluation will be required to be clear on these aspects.",
