      "content": "Wait, that 10,555,889 patent sounds pretty close to what we're doing. You mentioned it needs \"more evaluation,\" but I need a call right now. Given the \"high-load electronics\" application and the layered graphene-ceramic setup, how much of a threat is that actually? \n\nBe real with me—if we walk into that pitch room and an investor brings that up, are we going to look like we're trying to infringe on existing tech, or can we easily differentiate ourselves? I need to know if this is a minor hurdle or a dealbreaker.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
